   "label": "retrieve hotel authorization-hold guidance",
   "at": 139.0,
   "status": 200,
   "output": {
    "record_id": "471a2d47-a132-4551-a522-5f6ac88b48e7",
    "title": "Hotel authorization holds",
    "effective_at": "2026-07-01",
    "content": "Hotels commonly authorize an amount for incidentals on top of the room charges, so a hotel hold can exceed the room total. An authorization is approved only when the card's available credit covers the full authorized amount. No authorization is guaranteed to be approved. A hotel hold may remain pending for a few days after checkout, depending on when the merchant finalizes the charge."
   },
   "matches_recording": true,
   "write_tool": false,
   "reads": {
    "kb_records": {
     "keys": [],
     "queries": [],
     "scanned": true
    }
   },
   "writes": []
  },
  {
   "kind": "say",
   "role": "assistant",
   "speaker": "Adrian",
   "text": "So, um, hotels often don't authorize more than the total room charge for incidentals. The-- Your available credit is nine hundred and twelve dollars. So eight hundred and forty dollars charged should fit, but a larger hold may not.",
   "start": 139.12,
   "end": 153.4,
   "emotions": []
  },
  {
   "kind": "say",
   "role": "user",
   "speaker": "Colin",
   "text": "Right. Uh.",
   "start": 155.36,
   "end": 156.82,
   "emotions": [
    "confused"
   ]
  },
  {
   "kind": "say",
   "role": "user",
   "speaker": "Colin",
   "text": "Wait, could you, could you say it again, please? Uh. Yeah.",
   "start": 158.18,
   "end": 162.23,
   "emotions": []
  },
  {
   "kind": "say",
   "role": "assistant",
   "speaker": "Adrian",
   "text": "So, um, hotels often authorize more than the room total for incidentals.",
   "start": 162.26,
   "end": 167.14,
   "emotions": []
  },
  {
   "kind": "say",
   "role": "assistant",
   "speaker": "Adrian",
   "text": "But your available credit is nine hundred and twelve dollars only. So eight hundred and forty dollar charge should fit, but a larger hold might not.",
   "start": 167.86,
   "end": 176.1,
   "emotions": []
  },
  {
   "kind": "say",
   "role": "user",
   "speaker": "Colin",
   "text": "Right. Um, the clerk, uh, the clerk said that the room is six ninety, and the rest of it is a deposit, so- I think eight hundred and forty should be the whole hold, yeah.",
   "start": 177.48,
   "end": 187.52,
   "emotions": []
  },
  {
   "kind": "say",
   "role": "assistant",
   "speaker": "Adrian",
   "text": "Yeah. That works. Then it should enter and it be fine. So, um, I'd have them try once more. Not several times, just once. And if they change the amount, just ask them to tell you first, 'cause you don't want- you want it to fit.",
   "start": 187.88,
   "end": 201.28,
   "emotions": []
  },
